  "rows": [
    {
      "text": "When a student registers in a school, it is understood that he/she is",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.013217659667134285,
        "width": 0.4496123790740966,
        "x": 0.3294573688608848,
        "y": 0.2543604652328355
      },
      "level": 0.2546171538474484
    },
    {
      "text": "enrolling for the entire school year for high school or the entire semester",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.013308502733707428,
        "width": 0.4864341020584107,
        "x": 0.29457365150955434,
        "y": 0.26598837221926974
      },
      "level": 0.2656738698288209
    },
    {
      "text": "for a collegiate course. A student who transfers or otherwise withdraws,",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.014534883201122284,
        "width": 0.4903100728988648,
        "x": 0.292635667353862,
        "y": 0.27761627936600863
      },
      "level": 0.27727004414426387
    },
    {
      "text": "in writing, within 2 weeks after the beginning of classes and who already",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.013251726049929857,
        "width": 0.4922480583190918,
        "x": 0.29263565584045415,
        "y": 0.2905273436203353
      },
      "level": 0.2901811082100683
    },
    {
      "text": "paid the pertinent tuition and other school fees in full or for any length of",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.0146484375,
        "width": 0.4941860437393188,
        "x": 0.294573653033441,
        "y": 0.3022460936422714
      },
      "level": 0.3019315912767749
    },
    {
      "text": "time longer than one month may be charged twenty five percent (25%) of",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.013206304516643286,
        "width": 0.49612402915954595,
        "x": 0.29457364929619595,
        "y": 0.31540697678322316
      },
      "level": 0.3150924743565324
    },
    {
      "text": "the total amount due for the school term if he/she withdraws within the",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.01774446666240692,
        "width": 0.4982925653457641,
        "x": 0.2925177673246783,
        "y": 0.3252611051091725
      },
      "level": 0.32925670190354417
    },
    {
      "text": "first week of classes, or fifty percent (50%) if within the second week of",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.014534883201122284,
        "width": 0.5038759708404541,
        "x": 0.2906976684557421,
        "y": 0.33866279107385755
      },
      "level": 0.33828482277942223
    },
    {
      "text": "classes. The student will be charged all the school fees in full if he/she",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.014528618194162846,
        "width": 0.4982477029164632,
        "x": 0.29640440865316114,
        "y": 0.35041455169270275
      },
      "level": 0.35315506827615656
    },
    {
      "text": "withdraws anytime after the second week of classes. However, if the",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.01318359375,
        "width": 0.5019379854202272,
        "x": 0.29457363820073934,
        "y": 0.3647460938380712
      },
      "level": 0.3644315912297019
    },
    {
      "text": "transfer or withdrawal is due to a justifiable reason, the student shall be",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.013206304050981998,
        "width": 0.5038759708404541,
        "x": 0.294573634734812,
        "y": 0.3779069771029906
      },
      "level": 0.3775924744378697
    },
    {
      "text": "charged the pertinent fees only up to and including the last month of",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.013308502733707428,
        "width": 0.5058139562606812,
        "x": 0.2965116214626827,
        "y": 0.39098837233554873
      },
      "level": 0.39070560254384096
    },
    {
      "text": "attendance.\" (Manual of Regulations for Private Schools of 2008).",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.01744185946881771,
        "width": 0.46705424785614014,
        "x": 0.2945736571039066,
        "y": 0.4026162795315795
      },
      "level": 0.4023017772327334
    },
    {
      "text": "Also, a student who withdraws in writing before the official start of",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02136056497693062,
        "width": 0.4715363979339599,
        "x": 0.3369197162368948,
        "y": 0.42578627127389534
      },
      "level": 0.43467943336114745
    },
    {
      "text": "classes shall be charged P 4,000.00 for processing fee.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.022068621590733528,
        "width": 0.39593307177225756,
        "x": 0.29810444838381156,
        "y": 0.44025526226759515
      },
      "level": 0.4480139783411767
    },
    {
      "text": "VII. Class Attendance",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.014499014243483543,
        "width": 0.18263544638951618,
        "x": 0.2962743925164754,
        "y": 0.4715134922158539
      },
      "level": 0.47426510281430045
    },
    {
      "text": "1. A student who has incurred absences of more than 20% of the",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02561117894947529,
        "width": 0.5199934641520181,
        "x": 0.2980805459108105,
        "y": 0.4907208272561807
      },
      "level": 0.5021177776742667
    },
    {
      "text": "required total number of class and laboratory periods in a given",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02159290201961994,
        "width": 0.48315461476643884,
        "x": 0.3368619965524522,
        "y": 0.5064869629600963
      },
      "level": 0.5151311449865881
    },
    {
      "text": "term or semester shall be dropped from the course or subject.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.019650155678391457,
        "width": 0.4443626403808593,
        "x": 0.336872129684141,
        "y": 0.5216226087916916
      },
      "level": 0.5289383566346408
    },
    {
      "text": "2. No student who has been absent from classes for three (3)",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.023848766461014748,
        "width": 0.48527665932973224,
        "x": 0.294573643149991,
        "y": 0.5464299714464447
      },
      "level": 0.5575631233950362
    },
    {
      "text": "consecutive days shall be admitted without presenting to the",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.024746639654040337,
        "width": 0.4891792933146159,
        "x": 0.33871523323233915,
        "y": 0.5610505122244968
      },
      "level": 0.5725639750015505
    },
    {
      "text": "instructor concerned an excuse slip duly signed by his/her parent or",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.025245062075555325,
        "width": 0.4969867070515951,
        "x": 0.33480266891951205,
        "y": 0.5757130028852523
      },
      "level": 0.5859421436336212
    },
    {
      "text": "guardian. The excuse slip must be countersigned by his/her",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02662698831409216,
        "width": 0.4953037500381469,
        "x": 0.33852336390356114,
        "y": 0.589898151380748
      },
      "level": 0.6028796112539293
    },
    {
      "text": "principal, dean or Guidance Counselor. In case of absence due to",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.03130197525024414,
        "width": 0.4975126981735229,
        "x": 0.33635258350644953,
        "y": 0.6013267093721706
      },
      "level": 0.6171517782064282
    },
    {
      "text": "sickness for 3 days or more, the student should present a medical",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.028714163228869438,
        "width": 0.5012659231821697,
        "x": 0.33656253137091124,
        "y": 0.6183367395811642
      },
      "level": 0.631654792863181
    },
    {
      "text": "certificate countersigned by the school physician.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.026256371289491653,
        "width": 0.38282092412312835,
        "x": 0.33659075893992224,
        "y": 0.63674538085387
      },
      "level": 0.6477313282859368
    },
    {
      "text": "3. A student is required to be punctual and regular in his class",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.03437558561563492,
        "width": 0.5016552607218424,
        "x": 0.340258382943301,
        "y": 0.6608762271108437
      },
      "level": 0.679477057167982
    },
    {
      "text": "attendance. He/She must be in the classroom on time. Tardiness of",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.03589599393308163,
        "width": 0.5095005035400391,
        "x": 0.3363773631714629,
        "y": 0.6745192425771263
      },
      "level": 0.6948405175863229
